PSRR at 1\,kHz, 50\,mA (dB) & <<S1['psrr']['50mA']['1kHz']|.1f>> $\times$ & <<S2['psrr']['50mA']['1kHz']|.1f>> & <<S3['psrr']['50mA']['1kHz']|.1f>>\\
Line regulation, worst (mV/V) & <<max(S1['linereg']['0.1mA']['slope'],S1['linereg']['50mA']['slope'])*1e3|.1f>> $\times$ & <<max(S2['linereg']['0.1mA']['slope'],S2['linereg']['50mA']['slope'])*1e3|.1f>> & <<max(S3['linereg']['0.1mA']['slope'],S3['linereg']['50mA']['slope'])*1e3|.1f>>\\
